# AidFlow Initial Test Plan

## Purpose
This document outlines the initial tests planned for AidFlow.

## Test Cases

TC01 – User Registration
Verify that a donor can register with valid information.

TC02 – Donation Offer
Verify that a donor can submit an offer with an item description and quantity.

TC03 – Campaign Creation
Verify that a coordinator can create a campaign with requested items and a deadline.

TC04 – Offer Review
Verify that a coordinator can accept, reject, or request clarification for a donation offer.

TC05 – Inventory Integrity
Verify that pledged donations are not counted as received stock.

TC06 – Access Control
Verify that unauthorized users cannot view private donor information.

## Test Status
These test cases are proposed for future implementation and execution.
